The Python provider and its tests were extracted from the maintainer's experimental
Music Assistant checkout. This standalone adaptation adds packaging, safety fixes,
regression tests and release documentation. The built-in Nugs provider informed the
Music Assistant integration. Template-derived files have been adapted for LivePhish.

API protocol research reference:
